   "subject": "請教：如何相關性檢定cor.test中的數值提出並自製table？",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "不好意思，再來請教~<div>如題，假設我的data長這樣</div><div><div>y=c(4,0,0,4,7,-2,0,14,1,0)</div><div>base=c(2,0,0,1,0,2,0,2,0,0)</div><div>ad=c(35,5,5,10,45,0,0,15,0,30)</div><div>age=c(65.1,85.5,72,57.1,66.8,74.6,74.6,64.2,77.1,40.6)</div><div>volume=c(0.33,16.76,3.40,7.28,2.41,2.41,4.31,163.34,1.11,265.60)</div><div>data=as.data.frame(cbind(y,base,ad,age,volume))</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:medium\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;line-height:17px;text-align:-webkit-left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:1.3\">    y base ad  age volume\r\n1   4    2 35 65.1   0.33\r\n2   0    0  5 85.5  16.76\r\n3   0    0  5 72.0   3.40\r\n4   4    1 10 57.1   7.28\r\n5   7    0 45 66.8   2.41\r\n6  -2    2  0 74.6   2.41\r\n7   0    0  0 74.6   4.31\r\n8  14    2 15 64.2 163.34\r\n9   1    0  0 77.1   1.11\r\n10  0    0 30 40.6 265.60</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:1.3\"><br></pre></span></span></div><div># 我想執行每個x與y的相關性檢定(Pearson)，目前我知道可以用cor.test(y,base)，會得到一個htest object，我想抓出其中的&#39;<a href=\"http://conf.int\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://conf.int&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239015236000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cNgga-hKJQOacxqs0scU6\">conf.int</a>&#39;與&#39;p.value&#39;，並做成表格如下：</div><div>           <a href=\"http://conf.int\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://conf.int&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239015237000&amp;usg=AOvVaw020CNSesOzycVikCcEqh9r\">conf.int</a>   p.value</div><div>base    0.403       0.247</div><div>ad         ...</div><div>age</div><div>volume</div><div><br></div><div>不知道有沒有可能呢？</div><div>我自己嘗試寫以下程式...不過當然是不成功 XDDD   請教大家要怎麼寫比較好呢？謝謝!</div><div><br></div><div>output={}</div><div>for (i in 2:ncol(data)){</div><div>  out[i]=cor.test(y,data[,i])</div><div>  output$<a href=\"http://cof.int\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cof.int&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239015237000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26r1teQNkO3mgih2kO0tfS\">cof.int</a>[,i]=out[i]$<a href=\"http://conf.int\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://conf.int&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239015237000&amp;usg=AOvVaw020CNSesOzycVikCcEqh9r\">conf.int</a></div><div>  output$p.value[,i]=out[i]$p.value</div><div>}</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
