     1,
     "Hi, Karine,<div><br></div><div>Please enjoy the power of R !</div><div><br></div><div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>y=c(<span>4</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>4</span>,<span>7</span>,<span>-</span><span>2</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>14</span>,<span>1</span>,<span>0</span>)</p>\r\n<p>base=c(<span>2</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>1</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>2</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>2</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>0</span>)</p>\r\n<p>ad=c(<span>35</span>,<span>5</span>,<span>5</span>,<span>10</span>,<span>45</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>15</span>,<span>0</span>,<span>30</span>)</p>\r\n<p><span>age=c(</span>65.1<span>,</span>85.5<span>,</span>72<span>,</span>57.1<span>,</span>66.8<span>,</span>74.6<span>,</span>74.6<span>,</span>64.2<span>,</span>77.1<span>,</span>40.6<span>)</span></p>\r\n<p><span>volume=c(</span>0.33<span>,</span>16.76<span>,</span>3.40<span>,</span>7.28<span>,</span>2.41<span>,</span>2.41<span>,</span>4.31<span>,</span>163.34<span>,</span>1.11<span>,</span>265.60<span>)</span></p>\r\n</div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div><p>data=data.frame(y,base,ad,age,volume)</p>\r\n<p>data<br></p>\r\n<p>#cor.test(y,base)<br></p>\r\n<p>#with(data, cor.test(y,base))</p>\r\n<p>sresult &lt;- sapply(<span>2</span><span>:</span>ncol(data), <span>function</span>(u) cor.test(data<span>[</span>,<span>1</span><span>]</span>, data<span>[</span>,u<span>]</span>))<br></p>\r\n<p>final_result &lt;- t(matrix(unlist(sresult<span>[</span>c(<span>3</span>,<span>9</span>),<span>]</span>),<span>3</span>,))<br></p>\r\n<p><span>colnames(final_result) &lt;- c(</span>&#39;p.value&#39;<span>,</span>&#39;conf.int.lo&#39;<span>,</span>&#39;conf.int.up&#39;<span>)</span></p>\r\n<p>final_result</p></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
